# Popup UI rules

- The popup is React with plain CSS in `src/panel/popup.css`; no UI framework.
- Read and write settings only through helpers in `src/shared/settings.ts`.
- Save slider values on release, not on every input event: `chrome.storage.sync` has a write quota.
- Talk to the page only with the `ReaderMessage` types.
